{"ID":"20240118151110-fn12d7j","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151110-fn12d7j","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151110-fn12d7j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151110-uuzzr1s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135347-f2p9zhi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135347-f2p9zhi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:166,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:166\u0026#125;","title":"219松萝","type":"doc","updated":"20240201173114"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151110-uuzzr1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151110-uuzzr1s","updated":"20240122135331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒，治嗔怒，邪气，止虚汗，头风，女子阴寒肿痛。生川谷松树上。一名女萝。一名菘萝。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135334-7bjxzbr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135334-7bjxzbr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】松树上之地衣植物。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135335-6qk3f2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135335-6qk3f2c"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性平。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135338-rqkk2dz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135338-rqkk2dz"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为祛痰，涌吐药，可以吐痰涎，治温疟，项瘿及女子阴寒肿痛。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135340-e6e23x1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135340-e6e23x1"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗痰热温疟，可为吐汤，利水道。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135341-tmkcepq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135341-tmkcepq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治寒热，胸中客热痰涎，去头疮，项上瘿瘤，令人得眠。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135345-hs36p60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135345-hs36p60"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般二至四钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135346-jywmhyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135346-jywmhyi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】呕家禁用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135332-no3dotk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135332-no3dotk"}},{"ID":"20240122135347-nmnjqv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135347-nmnjqv4"}},{"ID":"20240122135347-f2p9zhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135347-f2p9zhi","updated":"20240201173114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"219松萝，这个松萝是吐剂，所以说药房也很少，因为我们现在用得吐剂的机会不多，像我们那苦瓜根吐剂，很多人说你胃里不舒服你不用吐剂还去买来喝，用手进去抠一抠把它吐出来的，方法很多，或手压内关对不对，手压内关心里想我要吐，就吐出来了，这个方法很多。那主治呢，去痰，能够去痰，呕吐，是涌吐的药，可以帮助吐掉痰涎，脖子的瘿肿，女人的阴寒都可以，现在用得不多。"}]}]}